{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "faded-chapter-api",
    "name": "Faded Chapter API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Faded Chapter Backend\nPhase 3F.2: Authentication endpoints (JWT-based)\n\n**Base URL**: http://localhost:3000\n**Database**: SQLite (persistent)\n\n**Features**:\n- User signup/login/logout\n- JWT token management\n- Session persistence",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "description": "Check if the server is running",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Signup",
          "description": "Create a new user account\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `email` (required): User email address\n- `password` (required): Strong password (8+ chars, uppercase, lowercase, number/symbol)\n- `firstName` (required): User first name\n- `lastName` (required): User last name\n- `marketingOptIn` (optional): Subscribe to marketing emails\n\n**Response**:\n- Returns JWT token\n- User object with email and verification status\n- Token valid for 24 hours",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"John\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n  \"marketingOptIn\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"John\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Doe\",\n  \"marketingOptIn\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n    \"emailVerified\": false\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "description": "Authenticate with email and password\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `email` (required): Registered email address\n- `password` (required): Account password\n\n**Response**:\n- Returns JWT token (valid 24h)\n- User object with ID and email\n- Email verification status\n\n**Demo User**:\n- Email: demo@faded.test\n- Password: Password123!",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"user-demo\",\n      \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\",\n      \"emailVerified\": true\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "description": "Logout and invalidate session\n\n**Headers Required**:\n- `Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}`\n\n**Response**:\n- Clears server-side session\n- Client should delete stored JWT token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "description": "Request password reset link\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `email` (required): Email address for password reset\n\n**Response**:\n- Sends reset email (Phase 3F.5)\n- Currently returns success placeholder",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Test Scenarios",
      "description": "Pre-configured test scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Full Flow: Signup → Login → Logout",
          "description": "Complete authentication flow test\n\n1. Creates new user\n2. Logs in with credentials\n3. Logs out\n\n**Step 1: Create a unique email**\nChange the email address to test multiple signups",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"test-{{$timestamp}}@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"TestPass123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Test\",\n  \"lastName\": \"User\",\n  \"marketingOptIn\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Test Invalid Password",
          "description": "Try login with wrong password\n\n**Expected Response**: 401 Unauthorized",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Test Duplicate Email Signup",
          "description": "Try to signup with existing email\n\n**Expected Response**: 409 Conflict\n**Error Code**: emailTaken",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"NewPass123!\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Another\",\n  \"lastName\": \"User\",\n  \"marketingOptIn\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Test Weak Password",
          "description": "Try signup with weak password\n\n**Expected Response**: 400 Bad Request\n**Valid password requirements**:\n- Minimum 8 characters\n- At least one uppercase letter\n- At least one lowercase letter\n- At least one number or symbol",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"weak@faded.test\",\n  \"password\": \"weak\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Weak\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Pass\",\n  \"marketingOptIn\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
